          },
          "docs": "This API enables you to consolidate multiple customer identifiers into a single, unified profile effortlessly. By integrating it with your Flow Designer, you can automatically retrieve and merge customer identifiers from various systems, such as your CRM or other third-party tools. This integration ensures all relevant data is consolidated into one profile, enhancing personalization and streamlining customer interactions. \n\n**Adding a New Alias** - To associate an additional alias (e.g., a new p"
        },
        {
